<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">{!Lead.FirstName},</font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">As promised, here is contact info for one of best lenders. Your next step is to complete the online application for financing. Once you are pre-approved, we will be ready to start building your portfolio together.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><b><br><a href="https://9266162696.mortgage-application.net/WebApp/FullAppLogin.aspx"><font color="#3366ff">Please use the link included in Ryan Craig's contact info</font>&nbsp;</a></b>below and complete the application. Ryan's team will reach out to you within 48 hours of receiving your application to introduce themselves and help you obtain the financing approval.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div>Let me know as soon as you receive your approval for financing, and schedule a call with me using the link in my email as soon you are approved so that we can begin review properties as the become available.</div><div><br></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Thanks,</span></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Marq</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);"><font color="#3333ff"><br></font></span></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://9266162696.mortgage-application.net/WebApp/FullAppLogin.aspx" style=""><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#3333ff">CLICK HERE FOR RYAN'S ONLINE APPLICATION FOR FINANCING.</font></b></a></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div style=""><table border="0" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12p